The '''Megalodon Pet''' is a {{skill|fishing}} [[Pets|Pet]] dropped rarely by [[Sharks (disambiguation)|Sharks]], which can be fished up during the [[Fishing Festival]]. It has a {{Green|1%}} drop chance.

== Obtaining ==
An {{Epic}} '''Megalodon Pet''' has a {{Green|1%}} chance to be dropped from a {{MobSprite|Tiger Shark}}, while a {{Legendary}} '''Megalodon Pet''' has a {{Green|1%}} chance to be dropped from a {{MobSprite|Great White Shark}}.

