== Trivia ==
* This pet was not available during the first Fishing Festival.
* {{RN|admin|Dctr}} leaked a version of the pet several hours before the second Fishing Festival. This version contained the {{AN|Tooth Collector}} Ability, which granted a {{Green|+15%}} chance to get Shark Teeth during the [[Fishing Festival]], an ability the current '''Megalodon Pet''' does not have.<ref>https://x.com/Dctrr/status/1305649231546462209</ref>
* This pet has the highest {{Stat|Sea Creature Chance}} (at 40) and {{Stat|Fishing Speed}} (at 80) of any fishing pet when equipped with the {{Item|Hephaestus Souvenir}} and while the Fishing Festival is active.
** Its {{Stat|Fishing Speed}} is tied with the [[Flying Fish Pet]], but the versatility of the latter not being event-locked makes it more useful.
* Its old {{AN|Enhanced Scales}} Ability used to refer to "Shark Armor", however, no such armor exists. It was later fixed to refer to [[Shark Scale Armor]].
* The {{Epic}} variant of this pet sells for {{c|500k}} to [[George]], while the {{Legendary}} variant sells for {{coins|2.5m}}.

